# <type>[(<scope>)][!]: <imperative summary>
#
# Body: usually 2–4 short prose paragraphs, about 80–150 words total.
# 1. State the problem/context and why it matters.
# 2. Describe the concrete change.
# 3. Add verification or an important limitation when useful.
# Skip details obvious from the diff; put attribution and issue trailers last.
#
# Types: feat fix refactor perf test docs build ci chore release revert
# Scope: stable owner such as cli, gateway, gui, or buildrules
# Title: English, imperative, no terminal punctuation, <= 80 characters
# Breaking: add ! before : and a BREAKING CHANGE: trailer
